# The Network: AI services
#
# Expects the AI Suite policy, referenced with extended-matching. Must precede the general proxy classification.
#
# extended-matching is not optional here. Clients that run their own encrypted DNS never ask the gateway to resolve, so they arrive as a raw IP with an SNI, and claude.com in particular resolves to GFW poisoned addresses on those clients. extended-matching matches on the SNI and hands the connection to the policy to resolve again, which replaces the destination rather than only changing the route. Without it those clients connect to a poisoned address and hang.
#
# This file owns the AI category outright rather than layering on top of a generic one. Generic AI classification gets two things wrong for this network: it treats the plain GitHub API as a model endpoint, and it misses several services in daily use here.
#
# Scope: a service earns a line when it is in use here or when it is an unambiguous AI product endpoint, meaning inference, chat, generation, or the agent tooling built on them. Benchmark sites, observability dashboards and vendor marketing stay out. An omission costs the ability to steer AI separately and to account for it as a category in the console, never connectivity, because everything else still lands on a proxy one way or another.
#
# Chinese providers live in AI/AIChina.list on the domestic path.

# Anthropic
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com

# OpenAI. The keyword covers Azure hosted deployments and the assorted api hosts.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sora.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,openai

# xAI. grok.x.com is exact: a suffix would swallow x.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grok.com
DOMAIN,grok.x.com

# Google
DOMAIN,ai.google.dev
DOMAIN,jules.google.com
DOMAIN,antigravity.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com

# GitHub Copilot. The model endpoint is githubcopilot.com; api.github.com is ordinary
# GitHub API traffic and lives in config/Surge/GitHub/GitHub.list.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubcopilot.com

